WEBVTT

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:02.860
Morning.

00:00:02.860 --> 00:00:04.450
Hey, did you watch it last night?

00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:06.280
It was so shocking!

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:10.320
“Here is a copy of the drawing.”

00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:12.000
Ryo-kun.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:13.200
What are you doing?

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:14.630
English homework.

00:00:14.630 --> 00:00:15.630
I knew it!

00:00:15.630 --> 00:00:17.050
Can I copy that afterwards?

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:18.140
It’s not mine.

00:00:18.140 --> 00:00:19.150
Ask Ojo.

00:00:19.150 --> 00:00:20.420
Oh yeah?

00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:22.760
Say Emi-rin, can I have it next?

00:00:22.760 --> 00:00:24.130
I don’t mind, but…

00:00:24.660 --> 00:00:26.630
“Ojo” and “Emi-rin”, huh?

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:29.360
Those are rather peculiar names.

00:00:29.360 --> 00:00:33.800
I have a proper name too;
it’s Mutsu Emiho.

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.650
Why not Emi-rin?

00:00:35.650 --> 00:00:36.800
Isn’t it cute?

00:00:37.980 --> 00:00:39.770
It must be a difference in our tastes.

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:41.370
So, you need it again because…

00:00:41.370 --> 00:00:42.070
Yup.

00:00:42.070 --> 00:00:44.050
I had my lesson and self-training.

00:00:44.050 --> 00:00:47.030
It sounds like a lot of work
just to become a voice actress.

00:00:47.030 --> 00:00:48.120
Oh no!

00:00:48.120 --> 00:00:51.400
Clear all the obstacles, and I will grab…

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:52.610
the position of an idol voice actress!

00:00:53.450 --> 00:00:55.510
Sometimes she’s a cool female warrior

00:00:55.510 --> 00:00:58.950
who fights in a fantasy world of swords and sorcery.

00:00:59.370 --> 00:01:01.480
Occasionally, she’s a sexy female detective

00:01:01.480 --> 00:01:03.960
who stands up to evil in the
crime-ridden world of the future.

00:01:04.550 --> 00:01:05.680
And at other times,

00:01:05.680 --> 00:01:08.960
she’s a delicate girl whose heart quivers with unfulfilled love.

00:01:09.590 --> 00:01:13.950
And at <i>other</i> other times,
she’s a mischievous magical fairy!

00:01:13.950 --> 00:01:17.970
Ranging from babies to grandmas, and even monsters and robots!

00:01:17.970 --> 00:01:22.690
Explosively popular, her overwhelming talents can play any role perfectly!

00:01:23.160 --> 00:01:27.150
The popular voice actress,
Moriya Miki-chan.

00:01:27.150 --> 00:01:28.770
So wonderful…

00:01:29.250 --> 00:01:33.240
Aren’t you happy to have a rising star as your friend?

00:01:33.240 --> 00:01:34.280
Not really.

00:01:34.280 --> 00:01:35.860
Don’t bother me, I’m doing homework.

00:01:36.860 --> 00:01:40.580
So your homework is more important than your future?

00:01:40.580 --> 00:01:43.580
It’s none of my business
what happens in your future.

00:01:43.580 --> 00:01:45.580
What? Are you trying to sell a fight to me?

00:01:45.580 --> 00:01:47.580
I’ll make it cheap for you, ma’am.

00:01:47.580 --> 00:01:48.750
Don’t call me ma’am!

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:51.110
Come on, Ryo.

00:01:51.110 --> 00:01:52.590
You’re no fun.

00:01:52.590 --> 00:01:53.850
Really?

00:01:53.850 --> 00:01:55.430
I’m normal.

00:01:55.430 --> 00:01:57.580
He seems normal to me too.

00:01:57.580 --> 00:01:58.720
Not at all.

00:01:58.720 --> 00:02:01.260
Something must have happened to your cute sister.

00:02:01.260 --> 00:02:04.180
Does it always have something to do with Akane when I’m in a bad mood?

00:02:04.180 --> 00:02:05.560
Do I need to answer that?

00:02:05.560 --> 00:02:07.020
Ugh…

00:02:07.310 --> 00:02:09.440
So what happened, Ryo?

00:02:18.070 --> 00:02:23.280
So I don’t spill my wish from my eyes,

00:02:24.080 --> 00:02:30.150
I want to make my heart race to you.

00:02:31.460 --> 00:02:37.510
I put my feelings on this palette of endearment

00:02:37.510 --> 00:02:43.140
and paint them on my heart.

00:02:44.060 --> 00:02:46.060
The sweetness

00:02:47.190 --> 00:02:51.150
and the strength you gave are sitting back to back.

00:02:51.150 --> 00:02:52.600
The time

00:02:54.360 --> 00:02:59.030
is drawing bells in the sky.

00:03:00.630 --> 00:03:07.160
Colorful assortments of balloons of dreams

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:09.050
float in the wind,

00:03:09.050 --> 00:03:10.930
flowing toward you,

00:03:10.930 --> 00:03:14.400
freely.

00:03:14.400 --> 00:03:21.220
I’m happy that I found destiny.

00:03:21.220 --> 00:03:24.850
It’s filling with colors.

00:03:24.850 --> 00:03:29.850
Love and Adoration for the Transfer Student!
Great Explosive Debut!!

00:03:34.390 --> 00:03:35.690
So that’s what happened.

00:03:36.700 --> 00:03:39.000
That sounds like trouble.

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:41.700
No wonder you couldn’t
do your homework.

00:03:42.190 --> 00:03:44.160
So you both believe me?

00:03:44.520 --> 00:03:46.240
Of course.

00:03:46.240 --> 00:03:50.910
If some stranger approached me and said “Let’s get married,”

00:03:50.910 --> 00:03:52.840
I would beat him up too.

00:03:53.470 --> 00:03:54.420
Me too.

00:03:54.970 --> 00:03:57.870
But it’s not really a unique story either.

00:03:58.590 --> 00:03:59.800
Huh?!

00:04:00.390 --> 00:04:02.840
Sorry, I wasn’t clear enough.

00:04:02.840 --> 00:04:06.920
It’s not rare to find marriages that ignore the desires of the marrying parties.

00:04:06.920 --> 00:04:08.520
Like shotgun marriages!

00:04:09.120 --> 00:04:11.310
No, that’s not it.

00:04:11.690 --> 00:04:13.240
Like a political marriage?

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:18.580
Your so-called fiancée may not have wished for it,

00:04:18.580 --> 00:04:22.320
but there’s some circumstance that prevents her from refusing it.

00:04:22.320 --> 00:04:24.070
Like she’s being coerced?

00:04:24.520 --> 00:04:25.620
Coercion?

00:04:26.370 --> 00:04:28.000
But she didn’t look like that.

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:28.920
OK.

00:04:28.920 --> 00:04:30.930
So, where is she now?

00:04:31.360 --> 00:04:32.220
Who knows?!

00:04:32.220 --> 00:04:34.060
I don’t care about that fool.

00:04:34.060 --> 00:04:35.770
You’re not being yourself, Mizuhara.

00:04:36.970 --> 00:04:39.220
You’re getting emotional.

00:04:40.790 --> 00:04:42.770
As far as I know,

00:04:42.770 --> 00:04:47.680
you don’t call people fools
without reason.

00:04:48.900 --> 00:04:51.810
Ojo, you just don’t know exactly what happened last night!

00:04:51.810 --> 00:04:52.360
We’re displaying an image according to Ryo.

00:04:52.360 --> 00:04:54.110
I won’t lose against
such a stupid chick!

00:04:54.110 --> 00:04:56.090
I’ll fight this to the end!

00:04:57.510 --> 00:04:58.870
Oh boy.

00:04:58.870 --> 00:04:59.740
I’ll burn her!

00:05:00.240 --> 00:05:03.160
Well, that’s fine for you.

00:05:04.320 --> 00:05:05.400
What do you mean?

00:05:06.860 --> 00:05:09.240
It’s okay for you to fight,

00:05:09.240 --> 00:05:13.040
but wouldn’t that make Kane-chan worry as she watches from the sidelines?

00:05:13.840 --> 00:05:16.930
So I’ll throw that wench out as soon as possible, and…

00:05:16.930 --> 00:05:18.080
Are you sure you can?

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:19.880
You tried being forceful
and lost, didn’t you?

00:05:21.720 --> 00:05:23.060
You can fight,

00:05:23.060 --> 00:05:27.370
but as far as I can tell, you can’t win if you go head-to-head with her.

00:05:28.300 --> 00:05:29.390
I know this is what you want now,

00:05:29.390 --> 00:05:32.540
but I think you need to come up with more realistic measures.

00:05:33.400 --> 00:05:35.710
Realistic measures…

00:05:35.710 --> 00:05:37.860
Pull yourself together, big brother.

00:05:37.860 --> 00:05:40.230
It’s all for your precious,
precious Kane-chan.

00:05:42.010 --> 00:05:43.280
Akane…

00:05:43.600 --> 00:05:44.870
Brother?

00:05:44.870 --> 00:05:46.150
Brother.

00:05:46.150 --> 00:05:47.620
Brother!

00:05:51.090 --> 00:05:52.120
Akane!

00:06:26.820 --> 00:06:28.110
Wha…

00:06:28.110 --> 00:06:28.820
What’s all this?

00:06:29.210 --> 00:06:30.200
Hey, a girl!

00:06:30.960 --> 00:06:31.940
She’s so pretty.

00:06:31.940 --> 00:06:33.280
Is she a transfer student?

00:06:33.280 --> 00:06:34.960
This is so incredible.

00:06:34.960 --> 00:06:36.920
Principal

00:06:40.040 --> 00:06:40.880
Hello.

00:06:45.550 --> 00:06:47.670
Hello everyone.

00:06:47.670 --> 00:06:49.950
My name is Masuda Shizuka.

00:06:54.840 --> 00:06:55.970
So cute!

00:07:06.090 --> 00:07:11.300
Mizuhara, I believe she has the same name as the so-called fiancée in your story.

00:07:12.020 --> 00:07:13.450
I’m not gonna respond to that.

00:07:13.450 --> 00:07:15.810
Planned
Mizuhara
Masuda Shizuka

00:07:15.810 --> 00:07:15.910
Well, so…

00:07:15.910 --> 00:07:18.680
Masuda Shizuka
Mizuhara
Planned

00:07:18.680 --> 00:07:19.410
Planned
Mizuhara
Masuda Shizuka

00:07:19.410 --> 00:07:21.250
Oh, Ryo-sama!

00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:23.710
Ugh! No!

00:07:25.000 --> 00:07:26.290
For real?

00:07:27.080 --> 00:07:28.280
Planned?

00:07:28.280 --> 00:07:28.880
Ryo-sama?

00:07:28.880 --> 00:07:29.500
So…

00:07:29.500 --> 00:07:29.820
that…

00:07:29.820 --> 00:07:31.220
means…

00:07:33.210 --> 00:07:35.060
So, Mutsu-san and everyone behind her,

00:07:35.670 --> 00:07:39.560
can you each move back 1 seat and open up the desk next to Mizuhara-kun?

00:07:41.050 --> 00:07:43.820
After all, Masuda-san and Mizuhara-kun

00:07:43.820 --> 00:07:47.690
are engaged and have been approved by both families!

00:07:47.690 --> 00:07:49.900
Congratulations, Mizuhara-kun!

00:08:03.940 --> 00:08:05.410
I came.

00:08:05.410 --> 00:08:06.710
You…

00:08:07.560 --> 00:08:09.080
You told me you were in 10th grade.

00:08:09.080 --> 00:08:10.970
How can you transfer into 11th?

00:08:12.170 --> 00:08:15.010
Isn’t political power useful?

00:08:15.010 --> 00:08:17.510
Yes…

00:08:18.720 --> 00:08:20.930
Now, let’s start class, everyone.

00:08:20.930 --> 00:08:24.600
Teacher! I don’t think it will be useful with all the guys dead.

00:08:24.600 --> 00:08:26.480
Yeah!

00:08:26.480 --> 00:08:28.170
Let them be.

00:08:28.170 --> 00:08:29.610
But!

00:08:29.610 --> 00:08:32.120
Is that your plan too?

00:08:32.120 --> 00:08:32.610
Huh?

00:08:33.520 --> 00:08:34.610
Don’t play dumb.

00:08:34.610 --> 00:08:37.280
She’s not our homeroom teacher.

00:08:38.200 --> 00:08:39.170
Really?

00:08:40.410 --> 00:08:44.160
Anyway, in order not to involve everyone else,

00:08:44.160 --> 00:08:46.920
please play along with me, Ryo-sama.

00:08:47.790 --> 00:08:49.710
Damn rich people…

00:08:51.670 --> 00:08:52.790
I see.

00:08:52.790 --> 00:08:54.340
She sure is tough.

00:08:54.950 --> 00:08:57.850
Poor Akane-chan.

00:08:57.850 --> 00:08:58.710
And then…

00:08:58.710 --> 00:08:59.850
And then

00:09:07.320 --> 00:09:09.970
Brother, how’s dinner tonight?

00:09:09.970 --> 00:09:12.450
Shizuka-chan cooked all of it.

00:09:12.450 --> 00:09:13.860
She did?

00:09:14.170 --> 00:09:14.850
Yes.

00:09:14.860 --> 00:09:18.030
I wanted to apologize about last night and express my love for you.

00:09:21.100 --> 00:09:22.200
Listen!

00:09:22.570 --> 00:09:25.920
Do you really think you’ll be forgiven with a mere dinner?

00:09:25.920 --> 00:09:27.870
If you want to apologize, then…

00:09:27.870 --> 00:09:28.700
Brother…

00:09:36.960 --> 00:09:39.390
Don’t make Kane-chan worry about you!

00:09:40.590 --> 00:09:43.140
Isn’t political power useful?

00:09:43.140 --> 00:09:46.630
She’s not someone you can fight head on.

00:09:46.630 --> 00:09:49.670
You’ll just end up being a slave to her!

00:09:53.210 --> 00:09:56.240
A realistic measure.

00:09:58.980 --> 00:10:01.800
My feelings won’t change no matter what you do.

00:10:02.300 --> 00:10:04.120
How long are you going to keep up this nonsense?

00:10:04.610 --> 00:10:07.300
Until your feelings change.

00:10:07.300 --> 00:10:08.550
And they won’t change!

00:10:09.320 --> 00:10:11.830
I don’t believe that.

00:10:11.830 --> 00:10:17.010
But if I learn that your mind will never change, then I will leave.

00:10:18.040 --> 00:10:19.300
Are you sure?

00:10:20.820 --> 00:10:21.800
Yes.

00:10:34.070 --> 00:10:36.520
Then fine.

00:10:36.520 --> 00:10:40.790
I don’t like it, but I will allow you to stay for a limited amount of time.

00:10:41.630 --> 00:10:43.370
Is that okay, Akane?

00:10:44.700 --> 00:10:45.870
Brother…

00:10:49.240 --> 00:10:53.000
Ryo-sama, Akane-san,
thank you very much.

00:10:53.000 --> 00:10:55.210
I appreciate your warm welcome.

00:10:56.120 --> 00:10:58.640
That’s exaggerating.

00:11:00.520 --> 00:11:04.640
Oh, also, we didn’t hire you as a maid.

00:11:04.640 --> 00:11:06.180
Share all the house chores.

00:11:06.180 --> 00:11:08.030
TV channels are decided by rock, paper, and scissors.

00:11:08.030 --> 00:11:09.110
Got it?

00:11:09.110 --> 00:11:10.140
Yes!

00:11:14.420 --> 00:11:15.630
Uh… Not that!

00:11:16.790 --> 00:11:17.730
What?

00:11:18.710 --> 00:11:20.190
The Miso soup is good.

00:11:26.120 --> 00:11:27.290
Brother!

00:11:27.290 --> 00:11:29.120
I’m sorry!

00:11:29.120 --> 00:11:31.990
I thought I might get kicked out again tonight,

00:11:31.990 --> 00:11:33.510
so I drugged it.

00:11:33.510 --> 00:11:34.830
I’m sorry.

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:38.920
In his fading consciousness,

00:11:39.710 --> 00:11:43.260
Ryo saw a devil behind the smiling mask.

00:11:43.260 --> 00:11:45.470
To be continued

00:11:45.470 --> 00:11:48.180
Man, you better do better than that, big brother.

00:11:48.180 --> 00:11:49.770
To be continued

00:11:51.140 --> 00:11:54.180
The moment came

00:11:55.020 --> 00:11:58.180
very much out of the blue.

00:11:59.420 --> 00:12:03.320
You showed up right in front of me,

00:12:03.320 --> 00:12:06.040
then started to change everything.

00:12:07.050 --> 00:12:09.870
If my meeting you

00:12:10.770 --> 00:12:13.720
is not by fate,

00:12:15.070 --> 00:12:19.080
there are no miracles,

00:12:19.080 --> 00:12:24.270
even if I search all over the world.

00:12:24.470 --> 00:12:27.660
Embracing love,

00:12:28.470 --> 00:12:31.590
kissing love,

00:12:32.340 --> 00:12:35.520
holding love,

00:12:36.020 --> 00:12:39.860
I whisper, “I love you.”

00:12:39.860 --> 00:12:43.850
Please look at me and me alone,

00:12:43.850 --> 00:12:47.270
forever.
